                "description": "Find businesses by their Google CID, a numeric identifier written in decimal digits, matched exactly. Accepts a comma separated list (e.g., `13842326799478219114`, `13039766440061011443`) or multiple `cid` parameters (e.g., `cid=13842326799478219114&cid=13039766440061011443`) of up to 20 values.\n\nWhen you send two or more of `business_id`, `cid` and `place_id`, a business matches if any of them matches, and every other filter still applies.\n\n**Examples:**\n\n`13842326799478219114`\n\n`13842326799478219114,13039766440061011443,11148341638623694071`"
