                "description": "Find businesses by the name on the owner profile.\n\nAccepts multiple `owner_name` parameters (e.g., `owner_name=value1&owner_name=value2`) of up to 20 values.\n\nValues cannot be comma separated here, as a comma can be part of the value. In the POST form, send an array instead.\n\n**Examples:**\n\n`Office of City Treasurer`"
